{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "GUN KING",
    "steam_appid": 2141810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141810/extras/da8b916117050bf1aa5b79cbbfd5aac4.poster.avif?t=1753847971\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141810/extras/da8b916117050bf1aa5b79cbbfd5aac4.webm?t=1753847971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive an endless horde of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover New Builds Every Run</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this rogue-lite horde survival game, level up to select from unique upgrade trees to mix and match a variety of upgrades to create your very own build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Select Your Gun</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of guns that offer a variety of gameplay experiences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 70 different upgrades you can choose from to create your very own build! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 15 guns and 30 gun mods to vary how you play each run. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timed survival or wave-based game modes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock gun mods each run to increase your power and build diversity even further.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141810/extras/da8b916117050bf1aa5b79cbbfd5aac4.poster.avif?t=1753847971\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141810/extras/da8b916117050bf1aa5b79cbbfd5aac4.webm?t=1753847971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive an endless horde of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover New Builds Every Run</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this rogue-lite horde survival game, level up to select from unique upgrade trees to mix and match a variety of upgrades to create your very own build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Select Your Gun</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of guns that offer a variety of gameplay experiences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 70 different upgrades you can choose from to create your very own build! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 15 guns and 30 gun mods to vary how you play each run. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timed survival or wave-based game modes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock gun mods each run to increase your power and build diversity even further.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Gun King is a rogue-lite action game with a gun modifying mechanic that changes how you play and choose your upgrades. Strategize and unlock new gun mods to build synergies and blast through hordes of enemies!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil",
